1
00:00:02,925 --> 00:00:04,155
(Episode 8)

2
00:00:04,155 --> 00:00:09,207
I'm not sure if it's the right thing
to write this letter to you.

3
00:00:10,746 --> 00:00:12,030
But Jun Seo,

4
00:00:13,571 --> 00:00:17,372
I want you to know that
my life also became

5
00:00:17,372 --> 00:00:19,547
more beautiful than anything...

6
00:00:19,547 --> 00:00:21,846
after meeting you.

7
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:25,023
I am...

8
00:00:26,459 --> 00:00:29,754
so happy just to be close to you enough
so I can see you around.

9
00:00:29,754 --> 00:00:31,734
I wanted to tell you that, too.

10
00:00:34,796 --> 00:00:36,254
No matter what happens,

11
00:00:37,562 --> 00:00:39,477
we'll never be apart,

12
00:00:43,067 --> 00:00:44,276
and now...

13
00:00:45,666 --> 00:00:48,110
we have to go back
to being brother and sister.

14
00:00:51,515 --> 00:00:52,582
And...

15
00:00:54,347 --> 00:00:55,436
And...

16
00:00:57,907 --> 00:01:00,756
when written in a letter,

17
00:01:00,756 --> 00:01:03,561
everything seems too easy,
which makes me feel duped.

18
00:01:07,242 --> 00:01:08,462
Jun Seo,

19
00:01:10,244 --> 00:01:11,325
I love you.

20
00:01:13,548 --> 00:01:16,317
With a different meaning of the same word.

21
00:01:18,931 --> 00:01:20,534
So I'm happy.

22
00:01:32,959 --> 00:01:33,959
Eun Seo.

23
00:01:37,694 --> 00:01:39,376
What did you buy so much?

24
00:01:39,376 --> 00:01:41,329
Isn't it heavy? I'll carry it.

25
00:01:41,329 --> 00:01:42,430
It's been a long time.

26
00:01:46,251 --> 00:01:47,555
When you press the shoot button,

27
00:01:47,555 --> 00:01:50,155
the shutter will go off
after five seconds.

28
00:01:52,013 --> 00:01:53,013
Okay.

29
00:01:58,017 --> 00:02:00,435
You look great in these photos, as usual.

30
00:02:01,665 --> 00:02:04,026
Do not lose them, all right?

31
00:02:05,649 --> 00:02:08,528
Where should I put them?
Should I put them in my wallet?

32
00:02:08,528 --> 00:02:09,528
Wait.

33
00:02:14,145 --> 00:02:15,562
You don't have Yu Mi's photo.

34
00:02:16,585 --> 00:02:17,884
Don't I?

35
00:02:19,777 --> 00:02:21,297
Just put them in for now.

36
00:02:21,297 --> 00:02:24,493
When you have Yu Mi's photo,
you can put mine in with hers.

37
00:02:29,328 --> 00:02:31,787
You're saying that so you don't have
to put them in either, right?

38
00:02:32,864 --> 00:02:33,875
You got me.

39
00:02:54,974 --> 00:02:56,238
What?

40
00:02:56,238 --> 00:02:59,279
Did you say you want
to live with plants or dogs?

41
00:03:00,598 --> 00:03:02,254
Is that really your dream?

42
00:03:02,254 --> 00:03:04,305
Goldfish would be good, too.

43
00:03:04,305 --> 00:03:08,323
You have no idea how scary I can be.

44
00:03:08,323 --> 00:03:10,414
I never have any living creatures near me.

45
00:03:12,642 --> 00:03:15,356
I didn't ask you to take care of them.

46
00:03:15,356 --> 00:03:17,563
I mean if a man takes care of those,

47
00:03:17,563 --> 00:03:19,200
I would get married to him.

48
00:03:19,200 --> 00:03:20,888
Is that so?

49
00:03:20,888 --> 00:03:22,289
All right, good luck with that.

50
00:03:24,472 --> 00:03:25,587
You'll never do that.

51
00:03:30,559 --> 00:03:32,214
I spent too much.

52
00:03:43,150 --> 00:03:45,899
What is it? Is it your cashbook?

53
00:03:47,206 --> 00:03:48,297
Do you need more money?

54
00:03:49,591 --> 00:03:50,662
Then I can...

55
00:03:50,662 --> 00:03:51,867
Don't say another word.

56
00:04:17,663 --> 00:04:18,986
I am sorry.

57
00:04:20,311 --> 00:04:24,215
All the skills I've practiced are...

58
00:04:24,215 --> 00:04:25,467
so useless.

59
00:04:27,961 --> 00:04:30,087
Let me see what you're drawing secretly.

60
00:04:30,087 --> 00:04:33,150
No.

61
00:04:33,150 --> 00:04:34,168
No?

62
00:04:35,214 --> 00:04:36,512
Why are you all like that?

63
00:04:37,567 --> 00:04:38,922
What do you mean?

64
00:04:39,777 --> 00:04:42,173
Jun Seo didn't let me see his drawings.

65
00:04:42,173 --> 00:04:43,257
He didn't?

66
00:04:45,735 --> 00:04:49,536
He might draw something
that can't be seen.

67
00:04:50,454 --> 00:04:51,721
Such as...

68
00:04:53,181 --> 00:04:55,023
his secret lover.

69
00:04:59,876 --> 00:05:00,925
Excuse me.

70
00:05:43,060 --> 00:05:44,094
Marry me.

71
00:05:54,380 --> 00:05:55,764
Marry me, Choi Eun Seo.

72
00:06:33,474 --> 00:06:34,474
Hello.

73
00:06:52,233 --> 00:06:53,420
Are you waiting for someone?

74
00:07:00,626 --> 00:07:02,166
I called you too late, didn't I?

75
00:07:02,166 --> 00:07:05,376
No, I was going to call you, actually.

76
00:07:06,166 --> 00:07:07,846
Why? Did something happen?

77
00:07:07,846 --> 00:07:08,846
Well.

78
00:07:12,398 --> 00:07:15,711
I wanted to make kimchi stew, but...

79
00:07:15,711 --> 00:07:18,455
I wasn't sure when to add kimchi.

80
00:07:18,455 --> 00:07:19,734
So...

81
00:07:19,734 --> 00:07:20,734
I see.

82
00:07:21,239 --> 00:07:22,736
Do you want me to tell you?
Or write it down?

83
00:07:23,982 --> 00:07:25,186
No, it's okay.

84
00:07:28,182 --> 00:07:30,754
Why are you making kimchi stew,
by the way?

85
00:07:30,754 --> 00:07:32,729
I just...

86
00:07:32,729 --> 00:07:35,072
I don't have class tomorrow, so...

87
00:07:35,072 --> 00:07:36,986
I'm planning to go on a one-day hike.

88
00:07:36,986 --> 00:07:40,248
Do you remember the cabin
we used to visit? I'm going there.

89
00:07:40,248 --> 00:07:41,248
Really?

90
00:07:42,735 --> 00:07:43,843
Are you going with Yu Mi?

91
00:07:45,361 --> 00:07:47,860
No, I'm going alone.

92
00:07:54,363 --> 00:07:55,462
Do you want to join me?

93
00:07:56,890 --> 00:07:57,890
I...

94
00:07:58,954 --> 00:07:59,954
Right.

95
00:08:00,937 --> 00:08:02,277
- Yu Mi.
- Tae Seok.

96
00:08:09,721 --> 00:08:11,051
Marry me, Choi Eun Seo.

97
00:08:12,825 --> 00:08:14,042
Marry me.

98
00:08:14,641 --> 00:08:18,425
Mom keeps asking me
when we're getting married.

99
00:08:18,425 --> 00:08:19,603
What should I tell her?

100
00:08:25,960 --> 00:08:26,960
Do you want to come?

101
00:08:34,689 --> 00:08:35,689
Yes.

102
00:08:38,009 --> 00:08:41,491
We probably can't go together
once you get married.

103
00:08:44,289 --> 00:08:47,419
And also, it's just for a day, right?

104
00:08:49,152 --> 00:08:50,152
Yes.

105
00:08:51,289 --> 00:08:55,742
It's just siblings going on a hike
after a long time.

106
00:08:55,742 --> 00:08:56,742
It is, right?

107
00:09:03,246 --> 00:09:06,085
Yes, you should stay home today.

108
00:09:06,085 --> 00:09:08,674
Why? Are you going somewhere?

109
00:09:09,878 --> 00:09:10,912
Yes.

110
00:09:13,481 --> 00:09:15,791
I have a friend coming from Seoul.

111
00:09:15,791 --> 00:09:17,879
You know Seung Taek,

112
00:09:17,879 --> 00:09:20,318
who studied with me in the U.S.

113
00:09:20,318 --> 00:09:21,624
Yes.

114
00:09:22,512 --> 00:09:23,672
Yes.

115
00:09:25,094 --> 00:09:27,087
I'll call you when I'm back.

116
00:09:28,573 --> 00:09:29,573
Right.

117
00:09:37,141 --> 00:09:38,264
Yoon Jun Seo.

118
00:09:40,958 --> 00:09:45,321
What? A friend of yours
is coming from Seoul?

119
00:09:54,318 --> 00:09:56,139
Are you going home?

120
00:09:56,139 --> 00:09:57,389
What time is it now?

121
00:09:59,242 --> 00:10:00,883
Wait for me. I'll take you home.

122
00:10:00,883 --> 00:10:01,982
No.

123
00:10:03,010 --> 00:10:04,197
No.

124
00:10:05,522 --> 00:10:07,770
I'm going with Kang Hee.

125
00:10:08,557 --> 00:10:11,601
So, I would rather you didn't come.

126
00:10:13,310 --> 00:10:16,345
I will be back soon
after meeting Mom and Dad.

127
00:10:17,726 --> 00:10:18,929
You're lying, aren't you?

128
00:10:22,407 --> 00:10:25,189
Your eyes just widened.

129
00:10:25,189 --> 00:10:26,691
I'm just kidding.

130
00:10:30,382 --> 00:10:31,908
Have a good time.

131
00:10:31,908 --> 00:10:33,975
Please give them my regards.

132
00:10:36,222 --> 00:10:38,024
I'll see you later.

133
00:10:39,917 --> 00:10:40,917
And...

134
00:10:43,979 --> 00:10:45,715
on your way back,

135
00:10:45,715 --> 00:10:47,949
get me some squid from the store
near your house.

136
00:10:48,700 --> 00:10:49,700
All right?

137
00:10:52,180 --> 00:10:53,245
Okay.

138
00:11:47,965 --> 00:11:51,381
Kimchi stew tastes much better
when made with stir-fried kimchi.

139
00:11:51,381 --> 00:11:53,126
- I agree.
- Right?

140
00:11:59,076 --> 00:12:00,076
You got me.

141
00:12:02,692 --> 00:12:05,363
You said you didn't know how to make it.

142
00:12:05,363 --> 00:12:06,519
Did you lie?

143
00:12:08,467 --> 00:12:09,630
No.

144
00:12:12,246 --> 00:12:14,941
To say I called you
because I missed you...

145
00:12:16,122 --> 00:12:17,724
is embarrassing.

146
00:12:20,250 --> 00:12:21,250
I see.

147
00:12:24,770 --> 00:12:27,098
I'm hungry. Let's hurry.

148
00:12:27,098 --> 00:12:29,421
Okay, I got it. It's almost done.
Give it a bit more time.

149
00:12:31,001 --> 00:12:32,001
What is that?

150
00:12:32,754 --> 00:12:34,376
- What?
- It's raining, Eun Seo.

151
00:12:34,376 --> 00:12:35,376
Take them inside.

152
00:12:43,791 --> 00:12:45,201
Why is it raining all of a sudden?

153
00:12:55,596 --> 00:12:59,089
He never puts things in the right way.
What a mess.

154
00:13:06,526 --> 00:13:08,071
Did you come already?

155
00:13:08,885 --> 00:13:10,815
Tae Seok?

156
00:13:11,966 --> 00:13:13,337
Is Jun Seo not here?

157
00:13:13,337 --> 00:13:15,855
He went to meet his friend.

158
00:13:15,855 --> 00:13:16,890
What brings you here?

159
00:13:17,695 --> 00:13:19,159
Where is Eun Seo?

160
00:13:19,159 --> 00:13:22,290
She went out with her friend.

161
00:13:22,943 --> 00:13:24,658
You're just like me.

162
00:13:25,432 --> 00:13:28,395
- Have dinner with me.
- Okay.

163
00:13:32,911 --> 00:13:34,434
It's pouring.

164
00:13:35,415 --> 00:13:36,415
I know.

165
00:13:40,072 --> 00:13:41,131
Hello.

166
00:13:42,126 --> 00:13:43,447
Who is it?

167
00:13:43,447 --> 00:13:45,450
The management office? Yes.

168
00:13:47,920 --> 00:13:48,973
What?

169
00:13:52,787 --> 00:13:54,990
When will it be repaired?

170
00:13:58,258 --> 00:13:59,258
All right.

171
00:14:01,633 --> 00:14:02,844
Yes, I understand.

172
00:14:07,499 --> 00:14:08,759
What's wrong?

173
00:14:08,759 --> 00:14:10,009
What should we do?

174
00:14:13,247 --> 00:14:15,337
I don't think you can go back today.

175
00:14:18,658 --> 00:14:21,071
So, then...

176
00:14:25,627 --> 00:14:28,182
I think we need to spend the night here.

177
00:14:32,099 --> 00:14:36,523
Just the two of us?

178
00:14:42,117 --> 00:14:45,864
I lied.

179
00:14:49,262 --> 00:14:54,256
I didn't tell Tae Seok
I came here with you.

180
00:14:58,263 --> 00:14:59,722
Was I wrong?

181
00:14:59,722 --> 00:15:00,822
No.

182
00:15:02,451 --> 00:15:05,524
So did I. I lied, too.

183
00:15:09,009 --> 00:15:11,261
I didn't intend to, but I lied.

184
00:15:16,811 --> 00:15:17,949
They're getting late.

185
00:15:19,124 --> 00:15:20,124
They are, indeed.

186
00:15:22,098 --> 00:15:24,277
Her parents must be holding her back.

187
00:15:26,149 --> 00:15:27,477
Her parents?

188
00:15:29,138 --> 00:15:31,518
Do you mean Jun Seo's parents?

189
00:15:33,787 --> 00:15:36,134
They're in Seoul now.

190
00:15:39,202 --> 00:15:40,426
Is Eun Seo...

191
00:15:40,426 --> 00:15:43,869
There must be some miscommunication.

192
00:15:45,218 --> 00:15:48,055
You might even make a trip for nothing.

193
00:16:02,880 --> 00:16:05,579
Eun Seo?

194
00:16:08,369 --> 00:16:09,842
Where are you?

195
00:16:09,842 --> 00:16:10,911
I'm at my parents' house.

196
00:16:12,203 --> 00:16:13,326
Where are you?

197
00:16:15,076 --> 00:16:18,255
They won't let me go because it's raining.

198
00:16:19,348 --> 00:16:20,759
I will sleep over here.

199
00:16:22,092 --> 00:16:23,606
Are you sleeping over there?

200
00:16:31,284 --> 00:16:34,653
Are you? I see.

201
00:16:36,260 --> 00:16:37,303
Hello.

202
00:16:39,180 --> 00:16:40,766
Jun Seo.

203
00:16:41,787 --> 00:16:46,581
All right.
You'll come back early, won't you?

204
00:16:47,236 --> 00:16:50,319
Are you going to spend the night there?

205
00:16:54,971 --> 00:16:56,230
I see.

206
00:16:57,996 --> 00:16:59,146
All right.

207
00:17:01,250 --> 00:17:02,655
You sleep over there.

208
00:17:03,474 --> 00:17:04,886
You are sleeping over there.

209
00:17:35,272 --> 00:17:36,692
It reminds me of old times.

210
00:17:39,257 --> 00:17:40,709
When I had a nightmare,

211
00:17:41,842 --> 00:17:43,894
I always went to your room and cried.

212
00:17:46,835 --> 00:17:51,775
Then, I slept on your bed,
and you slept on the floor.

213
00:17:55,005 --> 00:17:56,056
Do you remember that?

214
00:17:58,363 --> 00:17:59,871
I remember everything now.

215
00:18:02,203 --> 00:18:04,790
Your beautiful sister, Yoon Eun Seo.

216
00:18:06,820 --> 00:18:07,820
Yes.

217
00:18:10,579 --> 00:18:14,334
I'll be your beautiful sister forever.

218
00:18:19,644 --> 00:18:20,644
Of course.

219
00:18:23,460 --> 00:18:28,080
I think being siblings is much better.

220
00:18:30,604 --> 00:18:35,423
Once we're siblings,
we'll be siblings forever.

221
00:18:39,651 --> 00:18:40,651
You're right.

222
00:18:44,132 --> 00:18:45,132
Yes.

223
00:18:45,132 --> 00:18:49,357
We're siblings for the rest of our lives.

224
00:18:53,232 --> 00:18:54,268
Yes.

225
00:18:59,704 --> 00:19:01,836
But what if I die first?

226
00:19:04,465 --> 00:19:06,498
Then who is going to take care of you?

227
00:19:08,080 --> 00:19:11,848
No. I'll die before you do.

228
00:19:14,151 --> 00:19:16,479
You shouldn't die leaving me alone.

229
00:19:16,479 --> 00:19:18,706
You shouldn't. Okay?

230
00:19:24,319 --> 00:19:29,930
I don't want to lose you again.

231
00:19:32,848 --> 00:19:34,769
I don't want to lose you...

232
00:19:36,350 --> 00:19:38,851
more than once in my life.

233
00:19:41,672 --> 00:19:43,063
So,

234
00:19:45,333 --> 00:19:47,211
I'll die first.

235
00:19:53,396 --> 00:19:54,412
I understand.

236
00:20:00,301 --> 00:20:02,959
I'll be by your side when you die.

237
00:20:06,358 --> 00:20:10,358
I'll hold your hand,
and I'll laugh with you.

238
00:20:12,265 --> 00:20:13,923
I won't let you go alone.

239
00:20:18,505 --> 00:20:20,413
I'll always be with you.

240
00:20:23,249 --> 00:20:25,987
Don't worry, okay?

241
00:20:28,352 --> 00:20:29,352
Yes.

242
00:20:31,512 --> 00:20:32,529
Okay.

243
00:20:37,199 --> 00:20:38,392
You...

244
00:20:41,517 --> 00:20:42,665
promise me.

245
00:21:01,373 --> 00:21:02,777
When did you know?

246
00:21:05,134 --> 00:21:07,343
When did you know?

247
00:21:07,800 --> 00:21:08,937
I've recently found out.

248
00:21:12,838 --> 00:21:14,936
I've known for a long time.

249
00:21:19,334 --> 00:21:20,919
It's been so hard.

250
00:21:22,317 --> 00:21:23,935
Do you think they're serious?

251
00:21:26,988 --> 00:21:30,224
Tae Seok, do you believe in fate?

252
00:21:32,749 --> 00:21:33,749
No.

253
00:21:35,750 --> 00:21:37,232
I only believe in myself.

254
00:21:39,365 --> 00:21:43,608
I didn't use to believe in fate, but...

255
00:21:45,702 --> 00:21:47,576
I've been thinking that...

256
00:21:50,574 --> 00:21:54,665
there might be fates
that are predetermined.

257
00:22:00,659 --> 00:22:03,429
Don't you think we are going against fate?

258
00:22:05,957 --> 00:22:08,805
Are we going against the fates
of Jun Seo and Eun Seo?

259
00:22:10,492 --> 00:22:12,118
So what? What if we do?

260
00:22:12,118 --> 00:22:14,231
It's my fate, too.
Mine is much more powerful.

261
00:22:14,231 --> 00:22:15,616
I will show them that.

262
00:22:18,727 --> 00:22:20,537
Sin Yu Mi, don't let up.

263
00:22:21,349 --> 00:22:23,257
You need to get married
to Jun Seo and be happy.

264
00:22:26,214 --> 00:22:27,706
I can't let up.

265
00:22:29,460 --> 00:22:30,528
I'm leaving.

266
00:23:35,004 --> 00:23:36,005
You came.

267
00:23:36,811 --> 00:23:38,561
When did you come?

268
00:23:38,561 --> 00:23:41,560
I just came.

269
00:23:42,436 --> 00:23:44,766
I guess you had drinks with your friend.

270
00:23:45,436 --> 00:23:47,631
So, I made porridge for you.

271
00:23:52,260 --> 00:23:54,144
Did you have a good time?

272
00:23:56,508 --> 00:23:58,966
Yes, I did.

273
00:24:09,269 --> 00:24:10,765
Hello.

274
00:24:10,765 --> 00:24:11,896
Excuse me.

275
00:24:48,650 --> 00:24:49,659
You came back.

276
00:24:57,577 --> 00:24:59,082
I came back early, didn't I?

277
00:24:59,082 --> 00:25:00,095
This is for you.

278
00:25:06,435 --> 00:25:07,758
You asked me to.

279
00:26:45,532 --> 00:26:46,532
Do you get it now?

280
00:26:48,518 --> 00:26:49,849
Is it him?

281
00:26:50,390 --> 00:26:51,546
That's how it is.

282
00:27:08,583 --> 00:27:12,021
Tae Seok, I think we need more beer.

283
00:27:12,021 --> 00:27:13,860
Can you bring some?

284
00:27:13,860 --> 00:27:15,624
Yes, just a moment.

285
00:27:28,339 --> 00:27:30,357
Who left this here?

286
00:27:32,475 --> 00:27:33,685
Is it Jun Seo's?

287
00:28:01,619 --> 00:28:04,756
Tae Seok, I think you drank too much.

288
00:28:04,756 --> 00:28:05,756
What?

289
00:28:07,774 --> 00:28:09,072
I haven't drunk much.

290
00:28:10,022 --> 00:28:11,696
I'm in the best mood now.

291
00:28:12,941 --> 00:28:14,208
It's so good.

292
00:28:15,789 --> 00:28:17,238
Let me have another one.

293
00:28:18,317 --> 00:28:19,599
Tae Seok.

294
00:28:20,558 --> 00:28:21,558
Yes?

295
00:28:23,052 --> 00:28:27,224
Yes, Eun Seo.

296
00:28:30,557 --> 00:28:32,293
What are you all doing?
Let's have a drink.

297
00:28:32,293 --> 00:28:33,775
Come on, have a drink.

298
00:28:34,499 --> 00:28:37,371
This round is very important.

299
00:28:37,371 --> 00:28:38,757
This round is for...

300
00:28:43,317 --> 00:28:44,605
our wedding announcement.

301
00:28:46,316 --> 00:28:47,495
Tae Seok.

302
00:28:49,179 --> 00:28:50,534
Right.

303
00:28:52,771 --> 00:28:55,534
Somebody said we need to plant a tree
to get married.

304
00:28:58,045 --> 00:29:00,299
A wedding? What are you talking about?

305
00:29:00,299 --> 00:29:02,077
What does a tree have to do
with a wedding?

306
00:29:02,077 --> 00:29:03,707
Eun Seo said that...

307
00:29:03,707 --> 00:29:06,535
she wanted to be a tree
if she were to be born again.

308
00:29:14,348 --> 00:29:17,432
That's interesting. A tree?

309
00:29:20,253 --> 00:29:21,386
I see.

310
00:29:23,575 --> 00:29:24,577
She did.

311
00:29:26,006 --> 00:29:27,121
That was...

312
00:29:30,887 --> 00:29:32,961
something Eun Seo said when she was young.

313
00:29:36,688 --> 00:29:37,688
Was it?

314
00:29:40,918 --> 00:29:43,179
You have so many secrets.

315
00:29:44,678 --> 00:29:48,732
We have lots of secrets.

316
00:29:50,608 --> 00:29:51,608
Don't we?

317
00:29:53,016 --> 00:29:55,467
Stop it, Tae Seok. That is enough.

318
00:29:58,040 --> 00:29:59,060
What did I do?

319
00:30:01,705 --> 00:30:05,477
I didn't do anything wrong for sure.

320
00:30:07,801 --> 00:30:09,459
I don't have any secrets,

321
00:30:11,279 --> 00:30:13,019
not even a small one.

322
00:30:15,750 --> 00:30:18,698
What about you, Eun Seo?

323
00:30:20,744 --> 00:30:22,807
Do you have a secret
that you can't say out loud?

324
00:30:22,807 --> 00:30:25,329
- Stop it.
- You don't get to yell at me.

325
00:30:25,329 --> 00:30:27,227
Stop, all of you. What are you doing?

326
00:30:28,361 --> 00:30:31,877
Is having secrets that bad?

327
00:30:34,250 --> 00:30:36,380
I like having them.

328
00:30:38,649 --> 00:30:43,453
Because I can keep them in my heart,

329
00:30:45,746 --> 00:30:48,132
so I feel fulfilled.

330
00:30:48,921 --> 00:30:50,253
Is that a wrong thing?

331
00:30:51,601 --> 00:30:52,601
To feel fulfilled?

332
00:30:55,121 --> 00:30:56,121
Do you feel fulfilled?

333
00:30:57,635 --> 00:31:00,077
What is wrong, Tae Seok?

334
00:31:03,803 --> 00:31:08,823
The secret. Can I tell you what it is?

335
00:31:12,627 --> 00:31:13,859
The secret is that...

336
00:31:15,779 --> 00:31:17,833
you like Jun Seo.

337
00:31:17,833 --> 00:31:18,987
Han Tae Seok.

338
00:31:21,080 --> 00:31:22,195
Do you want me to say that again?

339
00:31:27,865 --> 00:31:29,412
Choi Eun Seo...

340
00:31:33,026 --> 00:31:34,619
likes Yoon Jun Seo.

341
00:32:07,959 --> 00:32:09,018
I'm sorry.

342
00:32:17,520 --> 00:32:18,778
There's nothing to be sorry for.

343
00:32:20,991 --> 00:32:23,066
In order to get Eun Seo,

344
00:32:25,423 --> 00:32:26,987
I could even kill you.

345
00:32:32,913 --> 00:32:34,236
Tae Seok.

346
00:32:34,236 --> 00:32:39,648
That is the way in which I love Eun Seo.

347
00:32:49,219 --> 00:32:50,309
What is your way?

348
00:33:19,807 --> 00:33:20,888
Did you call for me?

349
00:33:26,503 --> 00:33:27,736
I will clean up.

350
00:33:37,845 --> 00:33:38,896
I am sorry.

351
00:33:40,157 --> 00:33:42,136
I am so sorry, Tae Seok.

352
00:33:45,237 --> 00:33:50,009
I believed it was going to work.

353
00:33:51,750 --> 00:33:52,889
It's my fault.

354
00:33:54,005 --> 00:33:56,095
It was so hard for me,

355
00:33:56,095 --> 00:33:58,206
and because it was so hard, I used you.

356
00:33:59,005 --> 00:34:00,447
I was so wrong.

357
00:34:01,991 --> 00:34:03,906
I didn't mean to hurt you.

358
00:34:07,510 --> 00:34:09,169
Then, don't hurt me.

359
00:34:11,742 --> 00:34:12,774
Tae Seok.

360
00:34:13,230 --> 00:34:14,353
I...

361
00:34:17,044 --> 00:34:19,080
I don't care if you love Jun Seo.

362
00:34:19,080 --> 00:34:20,339
Just like this moment...

363
00:34:21,732 --> 00:34:24,162
Even if you break my heart so much,
I don't care.

364
00:34:24,162 --> 00:34:25,429
I don't care about anything.

365
00:34:29,370 --> 00:34:32,086
All I need is you.

366
00:34:32,086 --> 00:34:33,434
You are all I need.

367
00:34:55,430 --> 00:34:56,472
Excuse me.

368
00:34:57,781 --> 00:34:59,823
How can I help you?

369
00:35:01,094 --> 00:35:04,002
Eun Seo... are you Choi Eun Seo's mother?

370
00:35:10,207 --> 00:35:11,673
My name is Han Tae Seok.

371
00:35:13,118 --> 00:35:14,447
Mom.

372
00:35:15,833 --> 00:35:16,895
You?

373
00:35:17,557 --> 00:35:20,461
Is this the guy who ran away
with Eun Seo the other day?

374
00:35:20,461 --> 00:35:22,888
You, it was all because of you...

375
00:35:29,089 --> 00:35:33,705
I have something to tell you.
Can I come in?

376
00:35:33,705 --> 00:35:36,436
Yes, please come in.

377
00:35:41,656 --> 00:35:43,866
Look, what are you doing?

378
00:35:43,866 --> 00:35:47,154
I am dating Choi Eun Seo.

379
00:35:49,048 --> 00:35:50,853
I need to talk with you about Eun Seo.

380
00:35:52,178 --> 00:35:53,882
You!

381
00:35:53,882 --> 00:35:55,945
What have you done,
how dare you come here?

382
00:35:55,945 --> 00:36:01,480
What did you do to my sister?

383
00:36:01,480 --> 00:36:02,765
What did you do?

384
00:36:03,409 --> 00:36:06,418
Do you think you can do whatever
because you're the director of the hotel?

385
00:36:06,418 --> 00:36:10,031
Do you want to get away with it like this?

386
00:36:11,285 --> 00:36:13,096
Do you think money can solve everything?

387
00:36:13,096 --> 00:36:14,767
It's not something
you can settle with money.

388
00:36:14,767 --> 00:36:16,479
Get out. You get out of here.

389
00:36:16,479 --> 00:36:20,602
Mom, I'm telling you
he's done something to Eun Seo...

390
00:36:20,602 --> 00:36:21,683
That is not why I am here.

391
00:36:22,576 --> 00:36:26,923
I came to tell you
I want to marry Eun Seo.

392
00:36:28,385 --> 00:36:29,804
I want to get married to Eun Seo.

393
00:36:30,847 --> 00:36:31,971
Please give me your permission.

394
00:36:33,367 --> 00:36:35,441
I promise I will make her happy.

395
00:36:37,008 --> 00:36:43,689
Do you want to get married to Eun Seo?

396
00:36:47,448 --> 00:36:48,563
Are you sure?

397
00:36:50,055 --> 00:36:54,261
Have you talked with Eun Seo already?

398
00:36:55,304 --> 00:36:58,512
Mom, what is there to talk about?

399
00:36:58,512 --> 00:37:00,659
He said he wanted to get married to her.

400
00:37:00,659 --> 00:37:01,845
I mean, that's...

401
00:37:06,707 --> 00:37:08,436
I look forward to it.

402
00:37:29,809 --> 00:37:31,750
(Director Han Tae Seok)

403
00:37:51,640 --> 00:37:58,299
Have you met Sin Ae?

404
00:37:59,897 --> 00:38:04,738
I am sorry.
I have met her without asking you.

405
00:38:07,105 --> 00:38:13,569
I am sorry. I have met Eun Seo, too.

406
00:38:16,048 --> 00:38:17,300
I am sorry.

407
00:38:33,144 --> 00:38:34,427
The reason I came here...

408
00:38:36,504 --> 00:38:43,307
is because someone wants to marry Eun Seo.

409
00:38:45,272 --> 00:38:46,306
Is that someone Tae Seok?

410
00:38:48,072 --> 00:38:49,072
What?

411
00:38:51,167 --> 00:38:54,867
You know that already. You know.

412
00:38:55,792 --> 00:38:59,269
Yes, I have known about it since...

413
00:39:01,170 --> 00:39:04,709
he is my son Jun Seo's friend.

414
00:39:05,988 --> 00:39:07,303
That is good.

415
00:39:09,035 --> 00:39:11,154
What is he like?

416
00:39:11,154 --> 00:39:13,517
Is he a nice person?

417
00:39:13,517 --> 00:39:16,253
No, I don't need to ask anything but this.

418
00:39:16,253 --> 00:39:18,381
He wants to get married to Eun Seo.

419
00:39:18,381 --> 00:39:21,416
If you were me, would you say "yes?"

420
00:39:23,454 --> 00:39:24,945
Eun Seo...

421
00:39:28,271 --> 00:39:30,737
has grown enough to get married.

422
00:39:34,343 --> 00:39:35,945
She has.

423
00:39:37,494 --> 00:39:38,737
I am sorry.

424
00:39:41,519 --> 00:39:43,464
While she was growing up that much,

425
00:39:44,550 --> 00:39:47,137
I couldn't do much for her.

426
00:39:51,327 --> 00:39:53,144
I was out of my mind. I really was.

427
00:39:55,230 --> 00:39:56,759
I was so selfish.

428
00:39:58,751 --> 00:40:00,433
I should've sent her with you.

429
00:40:02,302 --> 00:40:04,249
I couldn't even send her to college.

430
00:40:06,551 --> 00:40:08,457
I am the crazy one. Me.

431
00:40:10,614 --> 00:40:11,614
No, that's not true.

432
00:40:13,149 --> 00:40:15,634
She has grown up pretty and kind.

433
00:40:17,293 --> 00:40:19,658
Thank you so much...

434
00:40:19,658 --> 00:40:21,965
for raising her to be a beautiful woman.

435
00:40:23,255 --> 00:40:28,225
I know it is late, but...

436
00:40:31,368 --> 00:40:32,610
Eun Seo...

437
00:40:35,496 --> 00:40:37,875
Can you take her?

438
00:40:42,159 --> 00:40:43,159
What?

439
00:40:45,663 --> 00:40:49,250
She has the luck
to have a good man, but...

440
00:40:50,103 --> 00:40:52,897
what would happen
if his family learns how I live?

441
00:40:53,742 --> 00:40:56,841
Her brother being a gangster,
and her mother being...

442
00:41:01,063 --> 00:41:02,439
I think...

443
00:41:03,668 --> 00:41:07,629
Eun Seo was never meant to be my daughter.

444
00:41:07,629 --> 00:41:10,679
It has been too much for me to raise her.

445
00:41:11,724 --> 00:41:17,031
I meant to send her away every moment.

446
00:41:19,158 --> 00:41:21,704
Please take her,
so that she can get married...

447
00:41:22,685 --> 00:41:23,927
to a proper man.

448
00:41:24,956 --> 00:41:28,365
You must adopt her,

449
00:41:28,365 --> 00:41:30,406
and if she becomes
Professor Yoon's daughter,

450
00:41:30,406 --> 00:41:32,688
his family won't be against her
getting married to him.

451
00:41:33,693 --> 00:41:35,055
Please.

452
00:41:36,332 --> 00:41:37,984
I am begging you.

453
00:41:39,571 --> 00:41:40,918
Are you sure?

454
00:41:43,836 --> 00:41:45,039
Do you really mean it?

455
00:41:48,332 --> 00:41:49,991
Please.

456
00:41:50,716 --> 00:41:52,375
I am begging you.

457
00:41:53,756 --> 00:41:55,622
Please take Eun Seo.

458
00:41:56,379 --> 00:41:58,656
Please take Eun Seo.

459
00:41:59,244 --> 00:42:00,551
Please.

460
00:42:03,771 --> 00:42:04,997
Please.

461
00:42:12,121 --> 00:42:13,121
Mom.

462
00:42:19,041 --> 00:42:20,706
What are you doing?

463
00:42:20,706 --> 00:42:22,796
Why are you sending Eun Seo to my family?

464
00:42:37,147 --> 00:42:38,485
Why don't you say something?

465
00:42:39,346 --> 00:42:40,965
What are you thinking?

466
00:42:44,690 --> 00:42:45,707
Do you want this?

467
00:42:46,372 --> 00:42:49,421
No, who wants this cola?

468
00:42:53,033 --> 00:42:54,436
Don't you remember that?

469
00:42:58,234 --> 00:42:59,488
When you were little,

470
00:43:02,084 --> 00:43:05,029
even before you were in elementary school,

471
00:43:05,029 --> 00:43:07,559
you kept asking me to buy cola,
and I said "no."

472
00:43:08,549 --> 00:43:10,623
You ended up getting caught stealing one.

473
00:43:12,108 --> 00:43:13,108
What?

474
00:43:14,659 --> 00:43:16,193
What are you talking about?

475
00:43:16,193 --> 00:43:18,631
Although I hit you out of temper,

476
00:43:18,631 --> 00:43:20,458
I felt terrible.

477
00:43:23,263 --> 00:43:26,050
I couldn't afford a 15-cent can of cola,

478
00:43:27,320 --> 00:43:31,393
and had made my only daughter
a shoplifter.

479
00:43:35,295 --> 00:43:36,635
What could I do?

480
00:43:38,359 --> 00:43:42,106
It was your fate to meet a mother
who didn't even have 15 cents.

481
00:43:42,816 --> 00:43:44,465
It's also Eun Seo's fate that...

482
00:43:45,623 --> 00:43:50,342
the switching occurred and she met me,
who couldn't afford college tuition.

483
00:43:50,342 --> 00:43:51,401
So?

484
00:43:52,301 --> 00:43:56,168
Are you telling me to do nothing
about Eun Seo coming to my family?

485
00:43:58,006 --> 00:43:59,553
It is no one's fault.

486
00:44:01,117 --> 00:44:05,623
You and Eun Seo were switched,
and had to struggle.

487
00:44:07,446 --> 00:44:09,743
It was just all of your fates.

488
00:44:16,997 --> 00:44:20,019
Now, you and Eun Seo
get along with each other...

489
00:44:21,594 --> 00:44:23,959
like sisters.

490
00:44:23,959 --> 00:44:24,959
No, I can't.

491
00:44:26,015 --> 00:44:27,290
I can't do that.

492
00:44:28,048 --> 00:44:30,026
No, I won't do that.

493
00:44:31,448 --> 00:44:32,972
Why should I?

494
00:44:34,417 --> 00:44:36,612
I'm a daughter of a wealthy family
from the beginning.

495
00:44:37,881 --> 00:44:40,355
But why do I have to lose the man I like?

496
00:44:41,528 --> 00:44:43,517
Why do I have to lose everything?

497
00:44:45,040 --> 00:44:48,506
That is all mine. Mine.

498
00:44:48,506 --> 00:44:49,540
No.

499
00:44:50,290 --> 00:44:51,830
No, you're wrong.

500
00:44:53,011 --> 00:44:56,949
You blamed me for giving you...

501
00:44:56,949 --> 00:44:58,480
a ragged underskirt.

502
00:44:59,749 --> 00:45:03,133
But it wasn't like I gave you that...

503
00:45:03,133 --> 00:45:05,176
while I myself had good ones.

504
00:45:06,125 --> 00:45:09,753
I did everything I could.

505
00:45:10,902 --> 00:45:13,994
I gave you the best things
I could possibly get.

506
00:45:16,329 --> 00:45:19,449
I couldn't buy you anything as good
as those Eun Seo had.

507
00:45:21,119 --> 00:45:22,915
But I put all my heart into the clothes...

508
00:45:24,422 --> 00:45:27,400
whenever I bought them for you.

509
00:45:30,207 --> 00:45:31,291
Sin Ae.

510
00:45:33,447 --> 00:45:35,605
Now let it all go.

511
00:45:37,116 --> 00:45:38,808
And make up with Eun Seo.

512
00:45:40,789 --> 00:45:42,963
Will you do that, Sin Ae?

513
00:45:42,963 --> 00:45:43,963
No.

514
00:45:44,707 --> 00:45:46,775
No!

515
00:45:47,884 --> 00:45:49,366
Sin Ae!

516
00:45:49,366 --> 00:45:50,414
Sin Ae.

517
00:45:58,549 --> 00:45:59,655
Sin Ae.

518
00:46:08,828 --> 00:46:11,056
Jun Seo'll be back soon from school.

519
00:46:13,821 --> 00:46:14,821
Are you his sister?

520
00:46:18,876 --> 00:46:20,676
Would you like tea?

521
00:46:21,449 --> 00:46:22,558
I'm fine.

522
00:46:25,067 --> 00:46:26,067
Then...

523
00:47:07,483 --> 00:47:09,088
And now...

524
00:47:10,141 --> 00:47:12,832
we have to stay as brother and sister.

525
00:47:14,133 --> 00:47:15,280
Jun Seo,

526
00:47:17,094 --> 00:47:18,322
I love you.

527
00:47:21,325 --> 00:47:22,962
What is this about?

528
00:47:22,962 --> 00:47:25,587
I heard they called
Eun Seo and Tae Seok too.

529
00:47:25,587 --> 00:47:26,819
Did they?

530
00:47:27,475 --> 00:47:31,645
Jun Seo, why don't we tell them
about our wedding today?

531
00:47:45,513 --> 00:47:46,891
Can you get off first?

532
00:47:54,987 --> 00:47:56,261
Can you check out the trunk?

533
00:48:22,906 --> 00:48:24,052
Will you marry me?

534
00:48:26,032 --> 00:48:29,301
I'll do everything for you.

535
00:48:35,882 --> 00:48:40,740
You will all be part of our family soon.

536
00:48:42,586 --> 00:48:45,972
The reason we called you all to come...

537
00:48:48,715 --> 00:48:49,715
Honey.

538
00:48:53,281 --> 00:48:54,281
Eun Seo.

539
00:48:57,824 --> 00:48:59,023
Eun Seo.

540
00:49:00,269 --> 00:49:01,902
My daughter, Eun Seo.

541
00:49:04,326 --> 00:49:06,817
Jun Seo, Sin Ae.

542
00:49:09,694 --> 00:49:11,698
What is going on?

543
00:49:12,669 --> 00:49:13,906
We...

544
00:49:15,568 --> 00:49:18,819
have decided to adopt Eun Seo.

545
00:49:23,975 --> 00:49:25,700
Our Eun Seo.

546
00:49:25,700 --> 00:49:28,063
You'll be our real daughter.

547
00:49:32,236 --> 00:49:33,879
No, you can't.

548
00:49:33,879 --> 00:49:35,219
That's not going to happen.

549
00:49:37,128 --> 00:49:40,394
Do you know about Jun Seo and Eun Seo?

550
00:49:41,712 --> 00:49:43,775
They love each other.

551
00:49:43,775 --> 00:49:45,171
They are in love.

552
00:49:50,992 --> 00:49:53,002
What are you talking about?

553
00:49:55,279 --> 00:49:56,794
What do you mean?

554
00:49:59,928 --> 00:50:01,009
Who loves whom?

555
00:50:02,495 --> 00:50:03,835
Who? Whom?

556
00:50:04,496 --> 00:50:06,840
What do you mean?

557
00:50:06,840 --> 00:50:08,610
What are you talking about?

558
00:50:11,815 --> 00:50:13,819
Look at this yourself.

559
00:50:34,151 --> 00:50:35,963
Jun Seo, you...

560
00:50:37,239 --> 00:50:38,323
You...

561
00:50:39,119 --> 00:50:41,685
Dad, no.

562
00:50:41,685 --> 00:50:43,451
It's not his fault.

563
00:50:43,451 --> 00:50:44,884
I'm the one who loves him.

564
00:50:44,884 --> 00:50:46,256
He doesn't love me back.

565
00:50:50,908 --> 00:50:51,941
Jun Seo.

566
00:50:53,867 --> 00:50:56,739
What does this all mean?

567
00:50:57,811 --> 00:50:58,850
Jun Seo.

568
00:51:00,977 --> 00:51:02,138
Is it true?

569
00:51:03,399 --> 00:51:04,537
Is this true?

570
00:51:14,038 --> 00:51:15,051
Yes.
